ranslation":"and no","transliteration":"walā"},{"position":8,"text":"تَأْثِيمٌۭ","translation":"sin","transliteration":"tathīmun"}]},{"id":4759,"verseKey":"52:24","verseNumber":24,"arabic":"۞ وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ غِلْمَانٌ لَّهُمْ كَأَنَّهُمْ لُؤْلُؤٌ مَّكْنُونٌ","translation":"There will circulate among them [servant] boys [especially] for them, as if they were pearls well-protected.","transliteration":"wayaṭūfu ʿalayhim ghil'mānun lahum ka-annahum lu'lu-on maknūnun","audioUrl":"/audio/7/052024.mp3","segments":[[0,1,50,1070],[1,2,1080,2180],[2,3,2190,3460],[3,4,3470,4190],[4,5,4200,6210],[5,6,6220,7130],[6,7,7140,11000]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"۞ وَيَطُوفُ","translation":"And will circulate","transliteration":"wayaṭūfu"},{"position":2,"text":"عَلَيْهِمْ","translation":"among them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim"},{"position":3,"text":"غِلْمَانٌۭ","translation":"boys","transliteration":"ghil'mānun"},{"position":4,"text":"لَّهُمْ","translation":"for them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":5,"text":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","translation":"as if they (were)","transliteration":"ka-annahum"},{"position":6,"text":"لُؤْلُؤٌۭ","translation":"pearls","transliteration":"lu'lu-on"},{"position":7,"text":"مَّكْنُونٌۭ","translation":"well-protected","transliteration":"maknūnun"}]},{"id":4760,"verseKey":"52:25","verseNumber":25,"arabic":"وَأَقْبَلَ بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","translation":"And they will approach one another, inquiring of each other.","transliteration":"wa-aqbala baʿḍuhum ʿalā baʿḍin yatasāalūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/052025.mp3","segments":[[0,1,140,1120],[1,2,1130,2150],[2,3,2160,2840],[3,4,2850,4590],[4,5,4600,9700]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَأَقْبَلَ","translation":"And will approach","transliteration":"wa-aqbala"},{"position":2,"text":"بَعْضُهُمْ","translation":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum"},{"position":3,"text":"عَلَىٰ","translation":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā"},{"position":4,"text":"بَعْضٍۢ","translation":"others","translite